{"id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-algorithm.md","title":"GL Algorithm","display":"df-gl-algorithm — GL Algorithm","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-algorithm","aliases":["89-df-gl-algorithm"],"display":"df-gl-algorithm — GL Algorithm","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-gl-semantic]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-algorithm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-algorithm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-algorithm — GL Algorithm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7f2ee867f14428e3\" href=\"?note=7f2ee867f14428e3\" title=\"89-df-gl-semantic\">89-df-gl-semantic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>, with finite sets\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Natural numbers are identified with finite ordinals; hence a model on carrier\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> has <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\">\\(m=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}((m,R))\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}((m,R))\\)</span> is the frame predicate from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\)</span> is global GL-model truth on a\nset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> of Kripke models.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n(m,R,V)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;1\\le m\\le 2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|},\\quad\nR\\subseteq m\\times m,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{GLFrame}((m,R)),\\quad\nV:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(m),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\;\nV(p)=\\varnothing\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\},\\\\[1ex]\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\{0,1\\},\\\\\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\\;\n(M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n(\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)),\\\\\n1,&amp;\n\\neg\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\\;\n(M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n(\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n(m,R,V)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;1\\le m\\le 2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|},\\quad\nR\\subseteq m\\times m,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{GLFrame}((m,R)),\\quad\nV:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(m),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\;\nV(p)=\\varnothing\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\},\\\\[1ex]\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\{0,1\\},\\\\\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;\n\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\\;\n(M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n(\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)),\\\\\n1,&amp;\n\\neg\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\\;\n(M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n(\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\">\\(\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\\)</span> 是有限且可有效枚举的：载体、关系以及\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中有限多个命题变元的赋值都只有有限多种选择；其余变元统一赋假。</li>\n<li>本定义给出有界反模型搜索。它正确判定 GL 的事实还需要有限反模型界：\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(A\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>，则存在至多\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|}\">\\(2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|}\\)</span> 个世界的反模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"7f2ee867f14428e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-semantic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}((m,R))$ is the frame predicate from\n[[89-df-gl-frame]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}((m,R))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}algorithm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n(m,R,V)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&1\\le m\\le 2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|},\\quad\nR\\subseteq m\\times m,\\\\\n&\\mathrm{GLFrame}((m,R)),\\quad\nV:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(m),\\\\\n&\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\;\nV(p)=\\varnothing\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\},\\\\[1ex]\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}&:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\longrightarrow\\{0,1\\},\\\\\nd_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&\n\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\\;\n(M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n(\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)),\\\\\n1,&\n\\neg\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)\\;\n(M,A)\\notin\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n(\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)).\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\notin\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|}","display":false}],"bytes":2023,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1e4657a556ae258","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"91faecc96ddef326","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d04b869450b424f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]] → [[89-df-gl-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-gl-decidable]] → [[89-thm-gl-tree-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","71b4f56d6213ff7c","ab746eb779e20ce0","c6ab46cd662b1409","7f2ee867f14428e3","b47f1c6b1cd23b5e"]}